@model TrungTamNgoaiNgu.ViewModels.LopHocFilterViewModel
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http
@inject IHttpContextAccessor HttpContextAccessor
@{
    var role = HttpContextAccessor.HttpContext?.Session.GetString("VaiTro");
    var isAdmin = role == "Admin";
    Layout = isAdmin ? "_AdminLayout" : "_StudentLayout";
    ViewData["Title"] = "Nhóm & Lịch Lớp Học · LanguageBook";
}

<div class="container-xl py-3">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
        <div>
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-1 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <i class="bi bi-people-fill text-primary"></i> Nhóm & Lớp học
            </h3>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0 small">Danh sách các lớp học tập trung, lịch khai giảng và chỉ tiêu tuyển sinh</p>
        </div>
        @if (isAdmin)
        {
            <a asp-action="Create" class="fb-btn fb-btn-primary">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-1"></i> Tạo lớp học mới
            </a>
        }
    </div>

    <!-- 4.8 & 4.9: Filter & Sorting Card -->
    <div class="fb-card p-3 mb-3">
        <form method="get" asp-action="Index">
            <div class="row g-2 align-items-center">
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <input type="text" asp-for="SearchTerm" class="fb-input" placeholder="Tìm tên lớp, phòng học..." />
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-2">
                    <select asp-for="MaKhoaHoc" asp-items="Model.KhoaHocList" class="fb-input">
                        <option value="">-- Tất cả khóa học --</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-2">
                    <select asp-for="NgoaiNgu" asp-items="Model.NgoaiNguList" class="fb-input">
                        <option value="">-- Ngoại ngữ --</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-2">
                    <select asp-for="TrangThai" asp-items="Model.TrangThaiList" class="fb-input">
                        <option value="">-- Trạng thái --</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <!-- 4.9. Giao diện sắp xếp dữ liệu (6 tiêu chí) -->
                <div class="col-md-2">
                    <select asp-for="SortOrder" asp-items="Model.SortOrderList" class="fb-input border-primary fw-semibold" onchange="this.form.submit()">
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-1 d-flex gap-1">
                    <button type="submit" class="fb-btn fb-btn-primary w-100" title="Lọc"><i class="bi bi-funnel"></i></button>
                    <a asp-action="Index" class="fb-btn fb-btn-secondary" title="Đặt lại bộ lọc"><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>

    <!-- Class Cards List -->
    <div class="fb-card">
        <div class="fb-card-header">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success"></i>
                <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Tìm thấy @Model.TotalItems lớp học</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-muted small">
                Trang @Model.PageIndex / @Model.TotalPages
            </div>
        </div>

        @if (!Model.Items.Any())
        {
            <div class="p-5 text-center text-muted">
                <i class="bi bi-people fs-1 text-muted d-block mb-2"></i>
                <h6 class="fw-bold">Không tìm thấy lớp học nào phù hợp</h6>
                <a asp-action="Index" class="fb-btn fb-btn-secondary mt-2">Đặt lại bộ lọc</a>
            </div>
        }
        else
        {
            <div class="divide-y">
                @foreach (var item in Model.Items)
                {
                    var slotsTaken = item.DangKyHocs?.Count(d => d.TrangThai == "Đã xác nhận") ?? 0;
                    var slotsLeft = Math.Max(0, item.SoLuongToiDa - slotsTaken);
                    var pct = item.SoLuongToiDa > 0 ? (int)((slotsTaken / (double)item.SoLuongToiDa) * 100) : 0;

                    <div class="p-3 border-bottom d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3 hover-bg">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="fb-avatar fb-avatar-lg" style="background: #e7f3ff; color: #0866ff;">
                                <i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill fs-4"></i>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                                    <a asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@item.MaLop" class="fw-bold fs-5 text-decoration-none text-dark">
                                        @item.TenLop
                                    </a>
                                    <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">@item.KhoaHoc?.TenKhoaHoc</span>
                                    
                                    @if (item.TrangThai == "Đang tuyển sinh")
                                    {
                                        <span class="fb-badge fb-badge-green">Tuyển sinh</span>
                                    }
                                    else if (item.TrangThai == "Đang học")
                                    {
                                        <span class="fb-badge fb-badge-blue">Đang học</span>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        <span class="fb-badge fb-badge-red">Đã kết thúc</span>
                                    }
                                </div>

                                <div class="text-secondary small d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-3">
                                    <span><i class="bi bi-calendar-event me-1"></i>Khai giảng: <strong>@item.NgayKhaiGiang.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")</strong></span>
                                    <span><i class="bi bi-clock me-1"></i>@item.LichHoc</span>
                                    <span><i class="bi bi-geo-alt me-1"></i>Phòng: <strong>@item.PhongHoc</strong></span>
                                    <span><i class="bi bi-person-video3 me-1"></i>Giảng viên: <strong class="text-primary">@(item.GiaoVien?.HoTen ?? "Chưa phân công")</strong></span>
                                    <span><i class="bi bi-cash me-1"></i>Học phí: <strong class="text-success">@item.HocPhi.ToString("N0") VNĐ</strong></span>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Thanh sĩ số -->
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mt-2" style="max-width: 320px;">
                                    <div class="progress flex-grow-1" style="height: 6px; background-color: #dddfe2;">
                                        <div class="progress-bar @(slotsLeft <= 3 ? "bg-danger" : "bg-primary")" role="progressbar" style="width: @pct%;"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 11px;">@slotsTaken/@item.SoLuongToiDa học viên (còn @slotsLeft suất)</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Right Actions -->
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <a asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@item.MaLop" class="fb-btn fb-btn-primary fb-btn-sm">
                                <i class="bi bi-pencil-square me-1"></i> Xem & Đăng ký
                            </a>
                            @if (isAdmin)
                            {
                                <a asp-action="Edit" asp-route-id="@item.MaLop" class="fb-btn fb-btn-secondary fb-btn-sm" title="Chỉnh sửa thông tin lớp học">
                                    <i class="bi bi-pencil me-1"></i> Sửa
                                </a>
                                <!-- 4.13. Giao diện xóa lớp học -->
                                <a asp-action="Delete" asp-route-id="@item.MaLop" class="fb-btn fb-btn-sm text-danger border-danger-subtle bg-danger-subtle" title="Xóa lớp học khỏi hệ thống">
                                    <i class="bi bi-trash-fill me-1"></i> Xóa
                                </a>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
            </div>

            <!-- Phân trang Facebook Style -->
            @if (Model.TotalPages > 1)
            {
                <div class="p-3 d-flex justify-content-center gap-2">
                    @if (Model.HasPreviousPage)
                    {
                        <a asp-action="Index"
                           asp-route-pageIndex="@(Model.PageIndex - 1)"
                           asp-route-searchTerm="@Model.SearchTerm"
                           asp-route-maKhoaHoc="@Model.MaKhoaHoc"
                           asp-route-ngoaiNgu="@Model.NgoaiNgu"
                           asp-route-trangThai="@Model.TrangThai"
                           asp-route-sortOrder="@Model.SortOrder"
                           class="fb-btn fb-btn-secondary fb-btn-sm">
                            &laquo; Trang trước
                        </a>
                    }

                    <span class="fb-btn fb-btn-outline fb-btn-sm" style="pointer-events: none;">
                        @Model.PageIndex / @Model.TotalPages
                    </span>

                    @if (Model.HasNextPage)
                    {
                        <a asp-action="Index"
                           asp-route-pageIndex="@(Model.PageIndex + 1)"
                           asp-route-searchTerm="@Model.SearchTerm"
                           asp-route-maKhoaHoc="@Model.MaKhoaHoc"
                           asp-route-ngoaiNgu="@Model.NgoaiNgu"
                           asp-route-trangThai="@Model.TrangThai"
                           asp-route-sortOrder="@Model.SortOrder"
                           class="fb-btn fb-btn-secondary fb-btn-sm">
                            Trang sau &raquo;
                        </a>
                    }
                </div>
            }
        }
    </div>
</div>
